      "id": "q-tagline",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": -260,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Q1 \u00b7 Tagline\nNotes say \"Fifty states. One hydrogen economy. Built together.\" The brand guide still says \"One molecule. Every state. Zero excuses.\" Assumed the new line everywhere and dropped the old one from the footer.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-hero-mark",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": -260,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Q2 \u00b7 Hero mark\n\"USHA logo with dark background\" read as the full-color map on navy. Use the heroMark tweak above the artboard to compare spectrum and knockout.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-join-copy",
      "x": 2280,
      "y": -260,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Q3 \u00b7 Join section\nHome keeps the six Why Join cards (per the home note). \"PEOPLE. POLICY. MARKETS. / Your seat is at the table.\" assumed for the membership page only.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-footer",
      "x": 2640,
      "y": -260,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Q4 \u00b7 Footer\nNewsroom column kept (Media Room, Resources) plus both LinkedIn accounts as placeholders. Confirm whether Media Room transfers or is cut.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-logos",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": -260,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "Q5 \u00b7 Member logos\nTier lists updated from the notes; names stand in until logo files arrive. Confirm Pap\u00e9 stays in Champions and Allies gets Canadian Hydrogen Association.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
