      "text": "Design system sheet\nEvery token here matches the Brand & Design System v1.0 (Space Grotesk / Syne / Manrope, Fibonacci spacing) plus the CURRENT review notes: kinetic eyebrow, headline and stat color alternation, the standard purple-pill card, the new footer lockup, 501(c)(6). Section 11 lists what was applied and what is still open.",
